                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "JY-Voon",
                        "email": "jvoon@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "JY-Voon"
                    },
                    "message": "nit: \nIt seems like the properties to be updated here are nearly static, such as manufacturer, and firmware version.\nDo you have any better workaround, such as set the manufacturer by one-time polling?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 326,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Currently, the approach is consistent with that of GPU devices, so we will maintain this approach for now."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaPcieDevice.cpp",
                    "line": 326,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "JY-Voon",
                        "email": "jvoon@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "JY-Voon"
                    },
                    "message": "In case there is any non-static property(s) that requires runtime polling and shares a same NSM command for the fetching.\nOtherwise, I think we can drop it and just fetch these properties during initialization.\nHowever, this looks good for me now. \nWe could be having such a refactoring patch in the future maybe."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaUtils.hpp",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "JY-Voon",
                        "email": "jvoon@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "JY-Voon"
                    },
                    "message": "Please aligns the name of manufacturer with the previous one.\nEither reuse the previous format or update the previous implementation to the current's.\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/dbus-sensors/blob/150b1684b4cc6b0753ccb01607f41c8fb5f4face/src/nvidia-gpu/Inventory.cpp#L55"
                },
